# Browser
# Demon Wall attacks "as though it didn't have defender" (CR 609.4): for every other purpose it has defender. Bot1's Wall has
# two +1/+1 counters, so it may already attack; Assault Formation's "{G}: Target creature with defender can attack this turn
# as though it didn't have defender" may still target it, since it still has defender (a Wall that lost defender to attack
# would be no legal target, CR 115.1). Both permissions apply together (CR 609.4a). The Wall attacks and assigns combat damage
# equal to its toughness under Assault Formation (CR 510.1a), 5 as a 5/5: Bot2 goes from 20 to 15. In the browser, the Wall's
# face says it can attack as though it didn't have defender this turn, the effect's duration.

